Based on your directory listing, your recent screenshots are sitting right there in your main ~/Pictures/ folder.
To view the most recent ones directly from your terminal, run one of these commands:
## 1. View the very last file in that list (whitemarket_introspection_bug.png)

xdg-open ~/Pictures/whitemarket_introspection_bug.png

## 2. View the previous file (whitemarket_logic_poc.png)

